{"product_id":"the_philosophers_dog","title":"the_philosophers_dog","description":"\u003cp\u003eIn this lyrical and beautifully written book, Raimond Gaita tells inspirational, poignant, sometimes funny but never sentimental stories of the dogs, cats and cockatoos that lived and died within his own family. The Philosopher's Dog is above all a book about our creatureliness and its place in the understanding of our humanity.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 214 x 29\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Raimond Gaita\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780415309073\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 224\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45487647359129,"sku":"11RG9780415309073","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68591f935c895-the-philosophers-dog-Raimond-Gaita-_1.jpg?v=1753121243","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the_philosophers_dog","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}